{"full":"Amery2010/open-builder","name":"open-builder","description":"Open Builder is an open-source AI-powered app generator. Build web applications through natural language conversations.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":93,"forks":34,"created":"2026-02-26T14:11:49Z","updated":"2026-08-28T08:43:34Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://builder.u14.app","topics":["ai","ai-agents","ai-assistant","app-builder","app-generator","chatbot","code-generation","open-source","web-development"],"demo":"https://builder.u14.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:25.845Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:25.845Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:25.845Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:25:52.017Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:18:22.958Z","stars":93,"forks":34},{"at":"2026-10-04T05:48:46.286Z","stars":93,"forks":34},{"at":"2026-10-05T16:57:25.845Z","stars":93,"forks":34}],"technologies":["React"],"overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T05:15:49.141Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["AI-Powered Web App Generator — Describe in natural language, instantly generate runnable projects","The Tauri desktop build (macOS / Windows / Linux) provides local runtime capabilities such as stdio MCP. Web and experimental mobile builds intentionally omit local process and Skill script execution.","Native adapters are included for OpenAI Responses, Anthropic, and Google, plus OpenAI-compatible endpoints such as Ollama and other compatible gateways."],"features":["Natural Language to Code — Describe your idea, AI plans and generates the complete project structure","Live Preview — Browser-based sandbox powered by Sandpack, instant rendering on code changes","Multi-Framework Support — 20+ templates including React, Vue, Svelte, Angular, SolidJS, and Astro, with Open Builder-managed dependency profiles and verified Sandpack/Nodebox runtime locks","Smart File Operations — AI uses patchfile for precise modifications, avoiding unnecessary full rewrites","Dependency Management — AI can modify package.json and trigger dependency reinstallation"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Amery2010/open-builder/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6675b2e8dadb254128f8da239f4ae4bd34e21efcdc7b2eca645122ad4b61ad33","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T07:15:24.663Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:16:00.351Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"AI-Powered Web App Generator — Describe in natural language, instantly generate runnable projects","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Amery2010/open-builder/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"The Web app connects directly to the providers and approved remote tools you configure; provider settings, including API keys, are stored in browser local storage and are sent only when required by those configured services.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Amery2010/open-builder/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"Firecrawl is the default for new or reset settings and supports keyless search and page reading under IP-based limits; an optional API key raises those limits","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Amery2010/open-builder/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Install the official Codex CLI and sign in with codex login.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Amery2010/open-builder/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Open Builder checks login status but does not read, copy, or persist CLI credentials.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Amery2010/open-builder/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"6675b2e8dadb254128f8da239f4ae4bd34e21efcdc7b2eca645122ad4b61ad33","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Amery2010/open-builder/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T05:16:00.352Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-28T08:43:34Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sou